$date 2026-11-12T13:04:18 $end
$version FPGA_Design_Agent debug_core $end
$comment After arming, write 0x0042 to COUNT. Capture count on the rising edge of win_wr, 4 cycles before and 8 after, then read COUNT back. $end
$timescale 10000 ps $end
$scope module capture $end
$var wire 1 ! win_wr $end
$var wire 16 " count $end
$var wire 1 # TRIGGER $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
